  <para style="h">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Jewe Pawulo, imbohe ya Kristo Yesu, na mwene Data Timoteyo,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="PHM 1:1">Turakwandikiye wewe Filemoni, mwene Data dukunda cane kandi dusangiye ibikorwa, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na mushiki wacu Afiya, na Arukipo uwo dusangiye urugamba, n’ishengero rikoranira mu nzu yanyu:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data wa twese no ku Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo bibane namwe.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ashima Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Nama nshima Imana ibihe vyose iyo ndiko ndagusengera, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />kuko numvise ukwizera Umwami Yesu kuri muri wewe, n’urukundo ufitiye abizera bose. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Ndagusengera kugira ngo ukwizera dusangiye kwame ivyamwa, maze ubone gutahura ivyiza vyose dufise muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Urukundo rwawe rwanteye umunezero mwinshi rwongera runtera intege, kuko waremesheje imitima y’abizera.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo avugira Onezime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ni co gituma, naho muri Kristo nari gushobora kugutegeka gukora ivyo utegerezwa gukora, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />mpisemwo kubikwingingira mu rukundo. Ndakwinginze jewe Pawulo, umutama kandi vyongeye ubu nkaba n’imbohe ya Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />ningingira umwana wanje Onezime, uwo navyaye ndi mw’ibohero. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Yahora ari imburakimazi kuri wewe, ariko ubu ni uw’ikimazi kuri wewe no kuri jewe.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Ndamukurungikiye kandi umenye ko afise umutima nk’uwanje. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Nashaka ko agumana nanje kugira ngo amfashe mu kibanza cawe muri iki gihe ndi imbohe kubera Ubutumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ariko sinashatse kugira ico nkoze ntakugishije inama, kugira ngo iciza cose wonkorera ugikore bivuye ku mutima, ata gahato. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Birashoboka ko igituma yatandukanye na we igihe gito, kwari kugira ngo azogaruke ari uwawe ibihe vyose; <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />atakiri umugurano, ahubwo arengeye umugurano, ari mwene Data w’umukundwa. Ndamukunda cane ariko ndazi ko wewe umukunda kundusha, haba mu buryo bw’umubiri nk’umuvukanyi, canke nka mwene Data mu Mwami wacu.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />None rero nimba unyemera nk’uwo musangiye igikorwa, umwakire nk’aho woba wakiriye jewe ubwanje. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Nimba hari ikibi yagukoreye canke hari ideni agufitiye, urimparureko. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Jewe Pawulo, ndabikwandikiye n’ukuboko kwanje: nzorikuriha. Sinorinda kukwibutsa ko nawe umfitiye ideni ry’ubuzima bwawe. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ndakwinginze rero mwene Data ungirire ubwo buntu ku bw’Umwami; uremeshe umutima wanje muri Kristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ndakwandikiye nizeye ko uzokora ivyo ndagusavye, ndetse n’ibirengeye.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Kandi untegurire icumba, kuko nizera ko Imana izokwishura amasengesho yawe, maze ikandekura nkagaruka iwanyu vuba.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafura, uwo dusangiye ukubohwa muri Kristo Yesu, arabatasha.<verse eid="PHM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Mariko, Arisitariko, Dema na Luka, abo dusangiye ibikorwa, na bo nyene barabatasha.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami Yesu Kristo bubane n’impwemu yawe.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>